paper/src/main.tex:702:         t$_{\phi_G}$ & Time limit for searching useful edge automorphisms. & 2 & 2 \\
paper/src/main.tex:706:         $g_{\text{nbr}}$ & Minimum girth of neighbor solutions in TS. & $g_{\text{min}}$-2 & $g_{\text{min}}$\\
paper/src/main.tex:708:         Cost$_{\text{TS}}$ & Cost function used by TS. & $c_{\text{girth}}$ & $c_{\text{reg}}$ \\
paper/src/main.tex:709:         $C$ & Penalty constant for short walks with net voltage $0_\Gamma$ in $c_{\text{girth}}$. & 1000 & / \\
