+    ),
+    "hardness_basis": (
+        "Track B: Section 3.4.1's backtracking is replaced here by an exact "
+        "componentwise-automorphism scan, O(phi(45) phi(n) (L+Ew)); at the hard "
+        "preset n=50021 it tests 1,200,480 automorphisms (measured in selftest), "
+        "whereas the switching-invariant route uses at most 190 exact group/set "
